  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5bf1b02cc8e772d498d73d7e7f014351, type: 3}
  description: Kelpies are medium-sized fae beasts, shaped like sleek, predatory
    horses with a whipping fishy tail. They are fast, galloping with sudden surges
    that feel almost unnatural, especially near water. They make only animalistic
    sounds - snorts, shrill neighs, and wet, hungry breathing - like a horse imitating
    a predator.
